  "caption": "Instrumental original handheld JRPG reflective cue in E major, 6/8, 108 quarter-note BPM. Preserve the complete supplied 24-bar independent melody, varied phrase rests, explicit scene-specific support and bass. celesta lead with harp support. Clean restrained timbres, no extra notes or reharmonization, no distortion, vocals or fade.",
